nim.fade_out);\n finish();\n }\n\n @Override\n protected void onDestroy() {\n super.onDestroy();\n if (splashHandler != null) {\n splashHandler.removeCallbacksAndMessages(null);\n }\n }\n}"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"edit_file","tool_call_id":"toolu_bdrk_018AnqLrZo4KyiYxmyABKHpb","content":"The apply model made the following changes to the file:

